{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE5L0NydWVsJTIwUGV0ZXIlMjAlMjgyMDE5JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Cruel Peter","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/1CXlIZFOOjpEwoTbvqVLmp9zWrM.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6IMhJ8o93iNNSLRaSqIVIA1S5Y8.jpg","description":"It is Christmas 1908 in Messina, one of the richest merchant cities of the Mediterranean. Peter, the 13 year-old son of a rich English family is notorious for his cruelty to children, animals and servants. One night he is ambushed and wakes up in a coffin underground in the city's Gothic cemetery, buried in retaliation for his callousness by a servant boy from his mother's estate. When a powerful earthquake razes Messina to the ground, Peter is trapped and his whereabouts are forgotten. Until a century later an English archaeologist and his daughter arrive in the city.","releaseInfo":"2019","genres":["Horror","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.0","runtime":"95 min","cast":["Angelica Alleruzzo","Antonio Alveario","Aran Bevan","Alessio Bonaffini","Terence Booth","Claudio Castrogiovanni","Arcangelo Ciulla","Matteo De Gregori"],"director":["Christian Bisceglia"],"released":"2020-02-06T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"He was the cruellest of all","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Angelica Alleruzzo","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uuDGjmzqoRQSnRiFrYsmETAq5nc.jpg"},{"name":"Antonio Alveario","character":"Domestico","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/45ffj7Ezks9EUewAa9JQk1VLwyD.jpg"},{"name":"Aran Bevan","character":"Peter Hoffman"},{"name":"Alessio Bonaffini","character":"Padre Alfredo"},{"name":"Terence Booth","character":"Rod","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tmEiZCfxJsI9NZkAanvFdLRi0wR.jpg"},{"name":"Claudio Castrogiovanni","character":"Calarco","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7PrhcmMuD7agfGURkU5yl9tIDaL.jpg"},{"name":"Arcangelo Ciulla","character":"Niccolò"},{"name":"Matteo De Gregori","character":"Sconsacrato"},{"name":"Henry D